{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the one and only tiny split-screen racing tournament! </h2>Grab a friend (or none if no one is around), strap on your seat belt, and hit the road in more than 24 hot and lovely designed mini tracks. <br>It\u2019s fast, it\u2019s fun, it\u2019s exciting. <br>It\u2019s time for Mini Car Racing.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mini Car Racing \u2013 Tiny Split Screen Tournament features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A single-player and local multiplayer mode with 1-4 players<br></li><li>Play together or against your friends (if you have any) <br></li><li>Experience a fun and exciting road rage <br></li><li>Feel the speed of the tiny cars while bursting over one of the 24 specifically designed tracks <br></li><li>Enjoy an intriguing and action-packed soundtrack<br></li><li>Show your friends who the boss is \u2013 YOU!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game also features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>24 tracks <br></li><li>6 different tournaments<br></li><li>3 different difficulties <br></li><li>8 unique cars <br></li><li>1-4 players</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1535500?t=1725288332","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1535500?t=1725288332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1535500/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1725288332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1535500/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1725288332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the one and only tiny split-scree